# =====================================================================
# Release V044 -- drop phantom Completed / Completed_At from treatment_appointments
# =====================================================================
# Real Dentally treatment_appointments has NO completion field (only appointment_id,
# treatment_plan_id, bookable, position, notes, created/updated). Completed / Completed_At
# were a mock-only invention -> always NULL for real tenants (audit finding). No consumer
# (Gold Fact_Treatment_Appointments does not read them; treatment_plan_items.Completed is a
# separate, real field and is untouched). Removed from Bronze + Silver tables + loaders.
#
# DESTRUCTIVE: the two .Table.sql are DROP/CREATE -> Bronze + Silver Treatment_Appointments
# are emptied and rebuilt from Stage/Bronze. Deploy tables before SPs.
# AFTER deploy: reload treatment_appointments Bronze->Silver (Orchestrate_Build). No
# re-baseline (dropped columns carried no tested metric; they were NULL for real anyway).
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V044__treatment_appointments_drop_phantom_completed.manifest
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY   Fabric\Bronze.Treatment_Appointments.Table.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Silver.Treatment_Appointments.Table.sql

DEPLOY   Fabric\Bronze.usp_Load_Treatment_Appointments.StoredProcedure.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Silver.usp_Load_Treatment_Appointments.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
